# Feature Implementation Guidelines

## Adding New Screens
1. Create screen composable in [ui/screens/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/screens/)
2. Add navigation route in [MainActivity.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/MainActivity.kt)
3. Update bottom navigation if needed in [BottomNavigation.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/navigation/BottomNavigation.kt)
4. Create ViewModel if business logic is required

## Adding New Data Models
1. Create data class in [data/model/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/data/model/)
2. Add `@Serializable` annotation
3. Implement helper functions for display formatting
4. Add to API service interface
5. Update repository implementation
6. Add mock data if needed

## Adding New UI Components
1. Create composable in [ui/components/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/components/)
2. Follow naming convention: `ComponentName`
3. Use consistent theming from [Theme.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/theme/Theme.kt)
4. Implement proper state management
5. Add Modifier parameter with default value

## Pet-Related Features
- Pet data model: [Pet.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/data/model/Pet.kt)
- Pet card component: [PetCard.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/components/PetCard.kt)
- Pet care centers: [PetCareCenter.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/data/model/PetCareCenter.kt)

## Social Features (Future)
- User profiles and authentication
- Pet photo posting
- Likes, comments, and follows
- Community features
- Push notifications

## Location-Based Features
- Pet care center discovery
- Distance calculation
- Map integration
- Location permissions

## Data Persistence
- Room database for local storage
- SharedPreferences for user settings
- Image caching with Coil
- Offline support

## API Integration
- Replace mock service with real implementation
- Add authentication
- Implement proper error handling
- Add caching and offline support
